title: jscpd 5.3.2 detects two duplicate pairs and blocks dependency PR #122
description: The jscpd 5.3.2 update on PR #122 makes the zero-duplication CI gate fail on duplicated entry guard code and a JSON-export test payload. Consolidate the production guard and remove redundant test work without relaxing the zero threshold.
